      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "On June 27, Hermès presented its Spring-Summer 2027 men’s collection during Paris Men’s Fashion Week. Designed by the brand’s men’s creative studio, the season draws inspiration from the landscapes of the South of France. The designers chose silk, linen, gauze, and knitwear to create light, flowing silhouettes, while cutouts and micro-perforations bring breathability to leather pieces. Neutral tones such as sand gray, gravel gray, pewter, ebony, jungle green, and kraft paper set a relaxed, effortless summer mood.",
      "url": null,
