    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The collection features 40 looks built around lightweight materials like ripstop fabric, water-repellent cotton twill, technical silk, pure silk, linen, and cotton gabardine. Hermès also pushes its signature leather craftsmanship to new airy heights — polishing, cutout embroidery, micro-perforations, embossing, and contrast stitching make leather feel as soft and fluid as fabric. The perforated dots on straight-cut jackets, inspired by the archival Mangeoire bag, become a key motif of the season.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
