      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Haut à Courroies Bag ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The standout bag this season is the**Haut à Courroies Pitcher**, crafted from Barénia Faubourg calfskin. A padded technique builds a sculptural, voluminous frame, while leather edging and visible topstitching add details reminiscent of a baseball glove.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Zoom in for an ultra-clear visual experience.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The classic HAC bag returns in dark brown Volynka cross-grain reindeer leather, earthy Fjord calfskin, or a combination of natural tent canvas with jungle green Evercolor calfskin and gold Togo calfskin, infusing this icon with an outdoor, leisurely spirit.",
